        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions PR-LVG100SBR, 1\" Diameter Wood Door Handle Pair</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 1 Inch Diameter Wooden Door Handle Set comes packaged with 2 pulls and the hardware needed to mount them back-to-back. It can be mounted on wood, glass, or metal doors. Choose from 12 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths. The grip itself is available in <a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-Wood-tcmbiw.pdf?v=1704262248\">an array of different types of wood</a> including teak, mahogany, and cherry.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with Back to Back mounting (2 door pulls bolted to each other - 1 door pull for each side of a door). Includes lock down threaded rosettes to securely tighten the door pulls to the door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDon't see the right Wood Finish Color?  Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> and we can make it for you!\r\n<br>\r\nAlso available: Individual <a href=\"/products/1-inch-diameter-wooden-door-handle-first-impressions-lvg100sbr\"><b>First Impressions LVG100SBR Pull</b></a> for one side of a door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Livingston 01 Wood Door Handle Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Solid Wood</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-Wood-tcmbiw.pdf?v=1704262248\"><b>First Impressions Wood Color Guide (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-LVG01-specifications.pdf?v=1704262248\"><b>First Impressions PR-LVG100SBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>PR-LVG100012SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-2/3\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>PR-LVG100024SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-2/3\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>PR-LVG100SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-2/3\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This wood door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Different Wood Types</b> and <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back-to-Back mounting.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "1 Inch Diameter Wooden Door Handle Set",
                "description": "This 1 Inch Diameter Wooden Door Handle Set comes packaged with 2 pulls and the hardware needed to mount them back-to-back. It can be mounted on wood, glass, or metal doors. Choose from 12 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths. The grip itself is available in  different types of wood including teak, mahogany, and cherry.\r\n",
